---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Why Mahalunge", "item": "https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/mahalunge-pune" }
  ]
};
---

<Layout
  title="Mahalunge Pune Real Estate Guide 2026 | Prices, Infrastructure & Projects"
  description="Comprehensive guide to Mahalunge Pune real estate, property prices, flats near Hinjewadi and Baner, PMRDA Town Planning Scheme, and Mahindra Lifespaces upcoming 13.46-acre development."
  canonical="https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/mahalunge-pune"
  customSchema={breadcrumbSchema}
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 bg-charcoal-950 border-b border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gold-500/10 border border-gold-500/30 text-gold-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">
        <span>Micro-Market Intelligence</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-stone-100 max-w-4xl leading-tight">
        Mahalunge, Pune: <br />
        <span class="gold-gradient-text">The Epicenter of Residential Growth</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl font-light leading-relaxed">
        An exhaustive micro-market analysis exploring why Mahalunge–Nande–Maan is the premier destination for luxury home seekers and IT professionals working in Hinjewadi and Baner.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key Target Keywords Strip for SEO -->
  <div class="bg-charcoal-900 border-b border-white/5 py-4 text-[11px] text-stone-400 overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 flex space-x-6">
      <span>• Mahalunge Real Estate</span>
      <span>• Flats in Mahalunge Pune</span>
      <span>• Luxury Apartments Near Hinjewadi</span>
      <span>• Baner-Mahalunge Growth Corridor</span>
      <span>• PMRDA Town Planning Scheme</span>
      <span>• Mahindra Lifespaces Mahalunge 13.46 Acres</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Editorial Content -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-charcoal-950">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16">
      
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <article class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-stone-100 font-bold">
          1. The Strategic Convergence: Hinjewadi Meets Baner-Balewadi
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300 leading-relaxed">
          Mahalunge is situated at the golden nexus of Western Pune. For decades, home buyers were forced to compromise between proximity to Hinjewadi IT Park (with over 400,000+ tech employees across Phases 1, 2, and 3) and the upscale lifestyle hubs of Baner and Balewadi High Street. Mahalunge bridges this gap seamlessly, allowing residents to live in an ecologically protected green valley while remaining less than 10 minutes from both economic and social epicenters.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Section 2: PMRDA Master Plan -->
      <article class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 space-y-4">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-400 font-bold">Planned Infrastructure</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-100 font-bold">
          2. The PMRDA Town Planning Scheme & 36-Meter Road Network
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300 leading-relaxed">
          Unlike older, congested suburbs developed in piecemeal fashion, Mahalunge is anchored by the Pune Metropolitan Region Development Authority (PMRDA) model Town Planning Scheme. Key highlights include:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-400">
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✦</span>
            <span><strong>36-Meter Arterial Road:</strong> Multi-lane planned boulevards connecting directly to Hinjewadi Phase 1 without traffic bottlenecks.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✦</span>
            <span><strong>Underground Utility Conduits:</strong> Dedicated storm water drains, fiber-optic corridors, and concealed electricity grids.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✦</span>
            <span><strong>High-Tech Smart City Zone:</strong> Earmarked spaces for educational campuses, healthcare centers, and civic green belts.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <!-- Section 3: Mahindra's Landmark Entry -->
      <article class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-stone-100 font-bold">
          3. Mahindra Lifespaces: Institutional Leadership in Mahalunge
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300 leading-relaxed">
          In October 2025, Mahindra Lifespaces announced its strategic acquisition of 13.46 acres in the Nande–Mahalunge corridor with an estimated development potential of ₹3,500 Crore. As one of India’s most trusted publicly-listed developers, Mahindra brings institutional rigor, IGBC Platinum green standards, and uncompromising construction execution to the micro-market.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-4">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/5 text-center">
            <div class="font-serif text-2xl text-gold-400 font-bold">13.46 Acres*</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 mt-1">Acquired Land Size</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/5 text-center">
            <div class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-100 font-bold">₹3,500 Cr*</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 mt-1">Development Potential</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/5 text-center">
            <div class="font-serif text-2xl text-emerald-400 font-bold">2, 3 & 4 BHK*</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 mt-1">Upcoming Residences</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Section 4: Social Infrastructure Breakdown -->
      <article class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-stone-100 font-bold">
          4. Social Infrastructure & Academic Excellence
        </h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-gold-400 font-semibold">Schools & Universities</h4>
            <ul class="text-xs text-stone-300 space-y-1.5 pt-1">
              <li>• Mahindra International School (Hinjewadi)</li>
              <li>• Delhi Public School (DPS Pune)</li>
              <li>• Symbiosis International University</li>
              <li>• Vibgyor High School & Orchid School</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-gold-400 font-semibold">Healthcare & Lifestyle</h4>
            <ul class="text-xs text-stone-300 space-y-1.5 pt-1">
              <li>• Jupiter Hospital (Baner)</li>
              <li>• Manipal Hospital (Kharadi / Baner Clinic)</li>
              <li>• Balewadi High Street Dining Boulevard</li>
              <li>• Westend Mall Aundh</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- CTA Box -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-charcoal-900 via-charcoal-850 to-charcoal-900 border border-gold-500/40 text-center space-y-4">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-100 font-bold">Be the First to Know About Mahindra Mahalunge</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 max-w-lg mx-auto">
          Register your preliminary interest to receive early pre-launch announcements, brochures, and confidential cost sheets as soon as MahaRERA approvals are in place.
        </p>
        <button
          data-open-modal
          data-interest="Mahalunge Research Enquiry"
          class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-400 to-gold-500 text-charcoal-950 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hover:shadow-xl transition-all"
        >
          Register for Early Priority Access
        </button>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
